This health hero is bringing health care directly to the community. 

Jahmil Lacey, a student in the Charles Drew and UCLA joint medical program, began a program that offers free health services across five barber shops in LA. 

@PattersonNBC reports. Sponsored by @JNJNews. https://t.co/Q4lbCIAPY5

The first @JNJGlobalHealth, @JNJNews #COVID19 vaccine doses donated by the United States have landed in Afghanistan. This is another great boost for vaccine equity! 

Thank you @POTUS, @VP, @SecBlinken, @PowerUSAID for donating to #COVAX.

